    "point_system": "1-3 points per question, matching this app's existing style",
    "pass_rule_note": "Launched as a 56-question pool across 5 topics (schonzeiten 12, fischereischein 14, fischkunde 12, geraete 10, gewaesserschutz 8), sized as a full exam-prep pool for the NRW Fischerpruefung, same DN-54-style pattern already used for kyc_aml/kartellrecht/lksg/sportboot_binnen. Exam Simulation/Training should draw questions per topic proportionally, with auto-fail on 2+ wrong high_stakes questions given the animal-welfare/legal-compliance stakes of Schonzeit and gear-rule violations. See app/app.js's EXAM_QUESTION_COUNT_BY_TYPE / MAX_ERROR_POINTS_BY_TYPE / EXAM_TIME_LIMIT_MS_BY_TYPE / EXAM_TOPIC_DRAW for wiring (to be done separately, out of scope for this content-only module).",
